<Section collapsed="false" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 1" layout="Heading 1">Imports and Parameters</Text-field></Title>
<Group labelreference="L233" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">with(plots):
with(Interpolation):
with(Statistics):</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L235" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">paramList := [
# Physics
g   = 9.81,                 # gravitational acceleration
rho = 1.204,                # ISA reference air density at sea level

# Propeller
R = 5.1*2.54/2 * 1E-2,      # diameter: 5.1 inch (datasheet)
A = Pi*R^2,                 # Area of propeller disc 
e = ef*R,                   # estimate of the hinge offset (calculated from omega_n and k_beta!)
ef = 0.25,                     # MANUAL OVERRIDE
sigma = 0.215,              # see Propeller_Info.txt (measured)
theta_0 = 21.77*Pi/180,     # pitch angle theta0 of the propeller [deg] (datasheet)
theta_1 =0*Pi/180,          # blade twist (guess!)
a = 8,                      # slope of the blade lift curve (guess!)
b = 3,                      # number of blades
cd = 0.1,                   # coefficient of drag of blade (GUESS!)
c = 1.3E-2,                 # chord [m] (measured, approx)
mb = 5E-3/4,                # mass of one blade (measured, approx)
cg = 1.95E-2,               # distance between blade CoG and root of the blade
Ib = mb * cg^2,             # blade moment of inertia around hinge (estimate)
Mb = mb * g * cg,           # moment of blade around hinge (estimate)
k_beta = 1.07,              # in [N*m/rad] (measured, see Propeller_Bend.xlsx)
omega_n = 1415.6,           # in [rad/s] (measured, from FFT)
K = 0,                      # thrust distortion factor

# Motor
kv = 1750,                  # KV-rating of the motor
Umot = Umot,                   # Voltage across motor

# Vehicle
m = 0.5                    # mass [kg]
#Omega = kv*Umot*Pi/30      # angular velocity of motor [rad/s] 
]:</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L238" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal"></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
</Section>
<Section collapsed="false" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 1" layout="Heading 1">Derivation of the Flapping Equations (Blade Element Theory)</Text-field></Title>
<Group labelreference="L240" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">restart;</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L241" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal"># Centrifugal Moment: p464
M_CFConst  := -Omega^2*(a0 * (Ib + e*Mb/g)):
M_CFSine   := -b1s*e*Mb/g:
M_CFCosine := -a1s*e*Mb/g:
M_CF       := M_CFConst + M_CFSine*sin(Psi) + M_CFCosine*cos(Psi):</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L244" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal"># Aerodynamic Moment: derivation follows p464
alpha := theta_0 + r/R * theta_1 + U_P / U_T:
U_T := Omega * R * ( (r+e)/R + mu * sin(Psi) ):
U_P := Omega * R * (mu*alpha_s - v1/(Omega*R)*(1 + K*r/R*cos(Psi)) - r/R*(a1s*sin(Psi) - b1s*cos(Psi)) - mu*(a0 - a1s*cos(Psi) - b1s*sin(Psi))*cos(Psi)) + (r+e)*(q*cos(Psi) + p*sin(Psi)):
M_A := int(r * rho/2 * U_T^2 * a * alpha * c, r=0..R-e):
match(M_A = M_AConst + M_ASine*sin(Psi) + M_ACosine*cos(Psi) + sinTerm2*sin(2*Psi) + cosTerm2*cos(2*Psi) + sinTerm3*sin(3*Psi) + cosTerm3*cos(3*Psi), Psi, 'sol'):
assign(sol)
<Font style="Text">Note: the formula for alpha has U_P/U_T which is a small angle approximation. The actual matlab implementation uses atan2(U_P, U_T) which is more accurate.</Font></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L245" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal"># Moment due to weight of the blade
M_WConst  := -Mb:
M_W       := M_WConst:</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L243" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal"># Moment due to Gyroscopic effects
M_GSine   := -2*q*Omega*Ib:
M_GCosine := 2*p*Omega*Ib:</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L242" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">solve({
M_CFConst + M_AConst + M_WConst - a0*k_beta = 0,
M_CFSine  + M_ASine - b1s*k_beta = 0,
M_CFCosine+ M_ACosine - a1s*k_beta = 0},{a0, a1s, b1s}): assign(%);</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L248" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">factor(expand(subs(paramList, subs(paramList,a0))))</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
</Section>
